' 07b LFS export and import: the state of the spaces of a root crosses to a
' new node through the export and the import of the history repository, with
' no Reified code in either.
'
' Source of the LFS figure of ../design.md (section N20). The figure restates
' P9 design v2 section 9 (amendment A19) and the harness
' rholang/tests/reified_lfs.rs. It adds no new fact.
'
' Reading order, from the top to the bottom:
'   1. The source node plays block 1 natively: one durable space of each
'      registered family, the stored families with records and waiters,
'      VectorDB records and an agent space. The sweep leaves no volatile
'      channel, so temp, seq and HashSet spaces never reach the root. The
'      checkpoint gives the root R1.
'   2. The exporter of the history repository reads R1 in pages of 64 history
'      items, with the data items of each page.
'   3. The new node validates each page with its importer, as a node
'      validates the pages of a peer. A page with one changed data byte fails.
'   4. The new node sets the history items, the data items and the root R1.
'      Every space channel of block 1 holds the same records and waiters on
'      both stores.
'   5. Block 2 runs on both stores and gives the same record for each deploy,
'      and native replay certifies each deploy on the imported store.
'
' Colors come from concept-colors.iuml (aliases of the shared palette).
' Render: ./render.sh 07b-lfs-export-import.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startuml 07b-lfs-export-import
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml
$ca_base_skin()
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor $rrs_relation
  LifeLineBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ParticipantBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ActorBorderColor $rrs_relation
  GroupBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
}
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam NoteBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
title LFS export and import of the state of spaces
autonumber

participant "Source node\nblock 1" as SRC $rrs_host
database "Source store\nhistory trie" as SSTORE $rrs_storage
participant "Exporter of the\nhistory repository" as EXP $rrs_substrate
participant "New node\nimporter" as IMP $rrs_substrate
database "New store\nhistory trie" as NSTORE $rrs_storage
participant "New node\nblock 2" as NEW $rrs_host

== Block 1 on the source node ==
SRC -[$rrs_flow]> SRC : native play: durable spaces of every family,\nrecords, waiters, VectorDB records, an agent space
SRC -[$rrs_relation]> SRC : the sweep of each deploy:\nno volatile channel stays (QF-8)
SRC -[$rrs_effect]> SSTORE : create_checkpoint(): root R1

== Export in pages ==
loop until a page holds fewer than 64 history items
  EXP -[$rrs_relation]> SSTORE : get_history_and_data(start path, 64)
  EXP -[$rrs_flow]> IMP : one page: history items and data items
  IMP -[$rrs_relation]> IMP : validate_state_items(page, start path)
  note right of IMP
  A page with one changed
  data byte fails here.
  end note
end

== Import ==
IMP -[$rrs_effect]> NSTORE : set_history_items, set_data_items
IMP -[$rrs_effect]> NSTORE : set_root(R1)
NSTORE -[$rrs_relation]-> IMP : every space channel of block 1 holds\nthe records and the waiters of the source

== Block 2 on both stores ==
NEW -[$rrs_flow]> NSTORE : reset to R1, play block 2
NEW -[$rrs_relation]-> NEW : the same deploy records as on the source:\nroots, cost vectors, evidence bytes, event logs
NEW -[$rrs_relation]> NEW : native replay certifies each deploy\nof block 2 on the imported store

legend bottom
**Concept colors**
|<$rrs_host>       | host at the baseline: nodes and their runtimes |
|<$rrs_substrate>  | the exporter and the importer of the history repository |
|<$rrs_storage>    | stored state |
**Arrows**
|<$rrs_flow>       | call or transfer |
|<$rrs_effect>     | effect on the stored state |
|<$rrs_relation>   | read, check or internal step |
endlegend
@enduml
